    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "1A Derrynane Road is an excellent detached 4 bedroom house (100 sq. m.), occupying a prime position in the heart of Turners Cross, one of Cork City's most established and highly sought-after residential neighbourhoods. Beautifully presented throughout, this impressive home offers bright, generously proportioned accommodation, together with a rear yard and ample car parking.\r\n\r\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property's greatest assets. Situated just minutes from Cork City Centre, residents enjoy immediate access to an outstanding range of amenities, including cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, independent retailers and excellent public transport links. Turners Cross is renowned for its strong sense of community and is home to a wealth of sporting and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nFamilies are exceptionally well catered for, with a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools within walking distance, including Scoil Chríost Rí, Christ King Secondary School, Coláiste Chríost Éamann Rís, University College Cork, Munster Technological University, Cork College of FET, Cork University Hospital and the Bons Secours Hospital are all within easy reach, making the location ideal for families, students and healthcare .\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from convenient access to the South Link Road network, Cork Airport, the Jack Lynch Tunnel and the national motorway system, while Cork City Centre is just a short walk or drive away. Combining a prestigious address, spacious accommodation and exceptional accessibility, 1A Derrynane Road represents a rare opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of Cork City's most desirable residential locations.\r\n\r\nAccommodation: \r\nGround Floor:\r\nEntrance Hallway with tiled floor covering.\r\n\r\nLiving Room with marble fireplace with gas coal effect fire, dual aspect window, carpet floor covering.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 with carpet floor covering.\r\n\r\nBathroom with WC, WHB, tiled shower unit, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUtility Room plumbed for washing machine, door to rear, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nKitchen with fitted floor and eye level units, sliding door to rear yard, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nBedroom 1 with full length robe units, polished timber floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 with full length robe units, polished timber floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 with full length robe units, polished timber floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom with WC, WHB, bath with shower, bath unit tiled, tiled floor."
      },
      {
